What this repository does NOT contain
-------------------------------------
No robot model, meshes, policy weights, planner checkpoints, recordings or third-party source. Studio reads
those at run time from their own local checkouts (docs/CODE_REFERENCES.md):
  - g1-student-deploy: the frozen Flow student bundle, node.py, the MuJoCo G1 model
  - the SONIC release policy (ONNX), used only through the deploy bundle
They keep their own licenses and are not redistributed here.

